// Ratchet config for the *gating* typecheck (`bun run typecheck`).
//
// It inherits Nuxt's generated config verbatim — including the auto-import and
// module type augmentations under .nuxt/ — and adds no overrides. Because plain
// `tsc` does not parse Vue SFCs, this checks the whole plain-TypeScript surface
// of the app (server/, stores/, composables/, middleware/, plugins/, models/,
// config/) and silently skips .vue files.
//
// That split is deliberate. The TS surface is clean today and CI blocks merges
// on it. The SFCs under pages/ and components/ carry pre-existing type debt
// that predates any typechecking in this repo; they are covered by
// `bun run typecheck:full` (vue-tsc), which runs advisory-only in CI until the
// debt is paid down.
//
// Note this cannot live in the root tsconfig.json: that one pins
// `files: ["./models/Meta.d.ts"]`, which narrows the program to a single file.
{
  "extends": "./.nuxt/tsconfig.json"
}
